WEBVTT

00:01:49.900 --> 00:01:56.380
The tank itself was unusual in that it was vertical and looked like an old boiler.

00:01:56.380 --> 00:02:00.000
Inside the tank the subject wore a heavy glass bubble and you would have thought the whole

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:05.660
traption uncomfortable to say the least it was however effective of the 23

00:02:05.660 --> 00:02:09.740
students tested only two found the experience unpleasant some even called

00:02:09.740 --> 00:02:15.210
it exhilarating a number of students hallucinated dr. Jessup found the

00:02:15.210 --> 00:02:20.000
encephalographic evidence especially interesting and one Saturday afternoon in

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:23.810
April 1967 he decided to try the experience for himself

00:03:52.270 --> 00:03:54.520
Arthur, hey, Arthur!

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:04.400
Is that it?

00:04:04.400 --> 00:04:06.390
