00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:09.100
I hallucinated like a son of a bitch.

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:12.580
A variety of dream states, mystical states.

00:05:12.940 --> 00:05:15.220
A lot of religious allegory, mostly out of revelation.

00:05:15.300 --> 00:05:18.630
- You were in there close to five hours. - It felt like an hour.

00:05:18.710 --> 00:05:21.510
- I'd like to try that myself sometime. - You should. You'll like it.

00:05:22.360 --> 00:05:27.410
