and testing them. He's been doing this for three, four months. Did you know, uh, that

00:07:00.890 --> 00:07:06.190
jessup was into this kind of stuff not till you just told me what do you want honey how long are

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:12.460
you gonna let it rain it's okay i'll get it the last guy in the world i think he'll be screwing

